{"sha": "f94cde4c8430a55d103ba7b2a4198007729b871151d9753a6f71c5f9ba272797", "body": ["\\begin{solution}{pb:b2:powerseries:1}", "\\textbf{1.} 取 $a_n = r_n - r_{n+1}$，由分部求和：", "\\[", "\\sum_{n=N}^{M} a_nx^n", "= r_Nx^N + \\sum_{n=N+1}^{M} r_n\\bigl(x^n - x^{n-1}\\bigr)", "- r_{M+1}x^M .", "\\]", "当 $0 \\leq x \\leq 1$ 时，增量 $x^{n-1} - x^n$ 非负，", "且逐项相消得 $x^N - x^M$；记 $s = \\sup_{n\\geq", "N}\\abs{r_n}$：", "\\[", "\\Bigl|\\sum_{n=N}^{M}a_nx^n\\Bigr|", "\\leq s\\bigl(x^N + (x^N - x^M) + x^M\\bigr) = 2s\\,x^N \\leq 2s .", "\\]", "", "\\textbf{2.} 由 $r_n \\to 0$，$\\sup_{n\\geq N}\\abs{r_n} \\to 0$：", "第 1 小题恰为一致柯西准则在", "$\\intcc{0}{1}$ 上，故 $\\sum a_nx^n$ 在其上一致收敛，且", "其和函数连续（见\\cref{thm:b2:funcseq:seriestransfer}）。", "$1$ 处的值为 $\\sum a_n$，故 $1$ 处的连续性是", "\\cref{exo:b2:powerseries:9} 的径向极限。", "", "\\textbf{3.} 当 $\\abs x < 1$ 时，三个幂级数都", "绝对收敛，且 $\\bigl(\\sum a_nx^n\\bigr)\\bigl(\\sum b_nx^n\\bigr)", "= \\sum c_nx^n$（见\\cref{prop:b2:powerseries:operations}）。", "由第 2 小题，各因子及乘积两侧在", "$\\intcc{0}{1}$ 上连续（其系数级数", "由假设收敛）；令 $x \\to 1^-$ 代入恒等式，得 $AB = C$。", "", "\\textbf{4.} 此时", "\\[", "\\abs{c_n} = \\sum_{k=0}^{n}", "\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{(k+1)(n-k+1)}}", "\\geq \\sum_{k=0}^{n}\\frac{2}{n+2}", "= \\frac{2(n+1)}{n+2} \\geq 1,", "\\]", "由算术--几何平均不等式：$\\sqrt{(k+1)(n-k+1)} \\leq \\frac{(k+1) +", "(n-k+1)}{2} = \\frac{n+2}{2}$。级数 $\\sum c_n$ 的", "通项不趋于 $0$：柯西乘积发散，尽管", "两个因子均收敛（交错级数）。", "", "\\textbf{5.} 由\\cref{exo:b2:powerseries:5}可得", "$\\frac{-\\ln(1-x)}{1-x} = \\sum H_nx^n$（$\\abs x < 1$）。", "逐项求原函数", "（见\\cref{thm:b2:powerseries:calculus}~(2)），两边在", "$0$ 处均为零：", "\\[", "\\frac{\\bigl(\\ln(1-x)\\bigr)^2}{2}", "= \\sum_{n\\geq1}\\frac{H_n}{n+1}\\,x^{n+1} .", "\\]", "递减性：$(n+2)H_n \\geq (n+1)H_{n+1}$ 等价于 $H_n \\geq", "1$，对 $n \\geq 1$ 成立；又 $\\frac{H_n}{n+1} \\sim \\frac{\\ln", "n}{n} \\to 0$：在 $x = -1$ 处，级数由", "交错级数判别法收敛。代入 $x \\mapsto -x$，并", "在 $x = 1$ 处应用第 2 小题：", "\\[", "\\frac{(\\ln 2)^2}{2}", "= \\sum_{n\\geq1}\\frac{H_n}{n+1}(-1)^{n+1},", "\\]", "即所述的值。", "", "\\textbf{6.} $f(x) = \\sum(-1)^nx^n = \\frac{1}{1+x} \\to \\frac12$", "当 $x \\to 1^-$ 时，Abel 可和于 $\\frac12$。但", "部分和为 $1, 0, 1, 0, \\dots$，发散。", "", "\\textbf{7.} 给定 $\\varepsilon > 0$，取 $m$ 使 $\\abs{u_n}", "\\leq \\varepsilon$（$n > m$）；对 $N \\geq m$：", "\\[", "\\Bigl|\\frac{u_1 + \\dots + u_N}{N}\\Bigr|", "\\leq \\frac{\\abs{u_1} + \\dots + \\abs{u_m}}{N} +", "\\varepsilon\\,\\frac{N - m}{N}", "\\leq \\frac{C_m}{N} + \\varepsilon,", "\\]", "于是 $\\limsup \\leq \\varepsilon$ 对每个 $\\varepsilon$ 成立，", "即均值趋于 $0$。", "", "\\textbf{8.} 当 $0 \\leq x \\leq 1$ 时，$1 - x^n = (1-x)(1 + x +", "\\dots + x^{n-1}) \\leq n(1-x)$，于是", "\\[", "\\Bigl|\\sum_{n=0}^N a_n(1 - x_N^n)\\Bigr|", "\\leq (1 - x_N)\\sum_{n=1}^N n\\abs{a_n}", "= \\frac1N\\sum_{n=1}^{N}n\\abs{a_n} .", "\\]", "当 $n > N$ 时，$\\abs{a_n} = \\frac{n\\abs{a_n}}{n} \\leq", "\\frac{1}{N}\\sup_{m>N}m\\abs{a_m}$，且 $\\sum_{n>N}x_N^n \\leq", "\\frac{1}{1 - x_N} = N$：", "\\[", "\\Bigl|\\sum_{n>N}a_nx_N^n\\Bigr|", "\\leq \\frac{\\sup_{m>N}m\\abs{a_m}}{N}\\cdot N", "= \\sup_{m>N}\\,m\\abs{a_m} .", "\\]", "", "\\textbf{9.} 分解为", "\\[", "A_N - L = \\sum_{n=0}^{N}a_n\\bigl(1 - x_N^n\\bigr)", "- \\sum_{n>N}a_nx_N^n + \\bigl(f(x_N) - L\\bigr) .", "\\]", "第一项由第 7 小题知趋于 $0$（", "$n\\abs{a_n} \\to 0$ 的均值），第二项由第 8 小题（上确界趋于", "$0$），第三项则因 $x_N \\to 1^-$ 且 $f(x) \\to L$ 而趋于零。", "于是 $A_N \\to L$：陶伯定理。", "", "\\textbf{10.} 当 $x \\in \\intco{0}{1}$ 且 $N$ 任意时，", "$\\sum_{n\\leq N}a_nx^n \\leq f(x) \\leq M$（各项非负）。", "令 $x \\to 1^-$ 于有限和中，得 $\\sum_{n\\leq N}a_n \\leq M$。", "部分和单调递增且有界，故 $\\sum a_n$", "收敛，再由第 2 小题得 $\\lim_{x\\to1^-}f(x) =", "\\sum a_n$。", "", "\\textbf{11.} $\\sigma_N - L$ 是 $N$ 个数", "$A_n - L$（$0 \\leq n < N$）的均值，它们趋于 $0$：第 7 小题。", ""]}